    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "### Problem\n\n`vim.opt_local.fileencoding:get()` errors in non-modifiable buffer\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run `nvim --clean`\n2. Run `:setlocal nomodifiable`\n3. Run `:lua =vim.opt_local.fileencoding:get()`\n4. Error `E21: Cannot make changes, 'modifiable' is off`\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNo error\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nv0.13.0-dev-1868+gbe5167e21c\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nN/A\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nArch Linux\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nkitty 0.49.2\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-kitty\n\n### Installation\n\nbuild from repo",
